    "detailed_description": "<h2 id=\"system-architecture\">System Architecture</h2>\n<p>Built on <code>Flutter 3.29.2</code> with <code>Dart 3.7.2</code>. Backend uses Supabase for authentication, database, and edge functions. Google Maps and Places APIs handle geocoding and location services. Key packages include <code>geolocator</code>, <code>background_fetch</code>, <code>flutter_local_notifications</code>, and <code>go_router</code> for navigation.</p>\n<h2 id=\"key-features\">Key Features</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><em>Location Saving:</em> Search and save places using Google Places API with custom descriptions</li>\n<li><em>Proximity Notifications:</em> Background location monitoring alerts users when near saved locations</li>\n<li><em>Interactive Maps:</em> Google Maps integration displays user location and saved places</li>\n<li><em>User Authentication:</em> Supabase handles secure login and user management</li>\n<li><em>Social Framework:</em> Database structure supports future friend-sharing features</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"technical-challenges\">Technical Challenges</h2>\n<p>Future Development: Planned features include feed page completion, friend linking, profile pages, detailed location views with editing, map caching for faster loads, friend location filtering, image support, and manual marker placement.</p>",
